M_max (idx) = 27.42 at k = 29; first k with M(k)/k < 0.9: 30. Trials per point: 5.
Largest measured M over both variants: 29.70 (ptr, k = 32); no saturation found up to k = 32, so M_max is a LOWER bound on this core's memory-level parallelism. idx at k >= 30 is a code-generation artifact: the compiler moves the chain state into NEON lanes (ld1.s/mov.s per step; raw/q2_idx30_disasm.txt), while ptr stays scalar.
